\cb3     \cf5 \strokec5 businessStep2Desc\cf6 \strokec6 :\cf4 \strokec4  \cf6 \strokec6 "\cf7 \strokec7 Super fast registration. With email and password, you're in. No learning curve: everything is designed to be simple from the first access.\cf6 \strokec6 ",\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cb3     \cf5 \strokec5 businessStep3\cf6 \strokec6 :\cf4 \strokec4  \cf6 \strokec6 "\cf7 \strokec7 Operative immediately\cf6 \strokec6 ",\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\cb3     \cf5 \strokec5 businessStep3Desc\cf6 \strokec6 :\cf4 \strokec4  \cf6 \strokec6 "\cf7 \strokec7 Enjoy automatic subscription management, with the ability to customize offers and optimize revenue.\cf6 \strokec6 ",\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
