\cb3     \cf5 \strokec5 businessFaq2Answer\cf6 \strokec6 :\cf4 \strokec4  \cf6 \strokec6 "\cf7 \strokec7 Very soon! With ABBS, you can start seeing benefits in just a few days: automatic import of your subscriptions and centralized data allow you to save time right away. Many of our customers notice a more fluid management and a reduction in costs within the first month.\cf6 \strokec6 ",\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
