\cb3     \cf5 \strokec5 businessFaq3Answer\cf6 \strokec6 :\cf4 \strokec4  \cf6 \strokec6 "\cf7 \strokec7 Through our app, users discover new subscriptions in their area, receive personalized promotions, and receive intelligent notifications. You can create targeted offers, activate internal campaigns, and appear among recommended offers, increasing visibility and conversions naturally. It's like having a direct sales channel integrated into your routine potential customers.\cf6 \strokec6 ",\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
